---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms of Service for Animus Project.">
  <div class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none font-sans">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: 2026</p>

        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or participating in the Animus Project or mobile application, you agree to abide by these Terms of Service.</p>

        <h2>2. Community Participation & Free Access</h2>
        <p>Animus is free to download and use. Participating in questions and exploring collective consensus incurs zero monetary fees. In-app credits earned through reciprocity govern question submission, deduplication, and reach.</p>

        <h2>3. Respectful Conduct</h2>
        <p>Users must not submit illegal, defamatory, or abusive content. Animus reserves the right to moderate or reject questions that violate human dignity or community integrity.</p>

        <h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>The Animus consensus graph, architecture, and trademarks belong to the Animus Project. Aggregate statistical insights are shared in service of human knowledge and research.</p>

        <h2>5. Disclaimer & Warranties</h2>
        <p>The network is provided "as is". While we strive for absolute statistical accuracy, consensus reflects human community input at a given moment in time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
